          <div class="mt-9 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/[0.07] p-5"><p class="font-black text-grain-300">不走進稻田</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-white/58">留在柏油路、開放步道與指定觀景區域。</p></div>
            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/[0.07] p-5"><p class="font-black text-grain-300">不阻擋農路</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-white/58">拍照、停車與單車休息時，保留農機通行空間。</p></div>
            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/[0.07] p-5"><p class="font-black text-grain-300">自備防曬飲水</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-white/58">田野空曠少遮蔭，夏季避免正午久留。</p></div>
            <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/[0.07] p-5"><p class="font-black text-grain-300">帶走自己的垃圾</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-white/58">平日服務設施有限，不把農村當成商業園區。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-20 border-t border-rice-200 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="section-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.68fr_1.32fr] lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="text-balance mt-5 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight font-black text-rice-950 sm:text-6xl">出發前，旅人最常問</h2>
        <p class="pretty mt-6 leading-8 text-rice-800/65">田況、交通與活動可能隨時間調整。本站以農期與公開旅遊資訊整理，現場仍以當日指示為準。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="divide-y divide-rice-200 border-y border-rice-200">
        {faqs.map((faq, index) => (
          <details class="group py-6" open={index === 0}>
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-5 text-lg font-black text-rice-950">
              <span>{faq.question}</span>
              <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-rice-100 text-rice-700 transition group-open:rotate-45">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="max-w-3xl pt-4 pr-12 text-sm leading-7 text-rice-800/68">{faq.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sources（E-E-A-T 資料來源） -->
  <section id="sources" class="scroll-mt-20 border-t border-rice-200 pb-20">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] bg-rice-100 p-8 sm:p-12">
        <span class="eyebrow">Sources & Updates</span>
        <h2 class="text-balance mt-5 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight font-black text-rice-950 sm:text-5xl">資料來源與更新說明</h2>
        <p class="pretty mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-rice-800/72">
          本站為非官方旅遊指南，內容依公開資訊整理。以下列出各項資料的來源與同步時間，供旅人查核與延伸閱讀。
        </p>

        <dl class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] bg-white p-6 card-shadow">
            <dt class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-black tracking-[0.14em] text-rice-600">
              評價 · 同步時間 {reviews.syncedAt}
              <span class="rounded-full bg-grain-100 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] text-rice-800">Google Maps</span>
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-rice-800/72">
              評分與評價數同步自 Google 地圖用戶評價，同步時間 {reviews.syncedAt}；版權歸原作者與 Google 地圖所有。評價僅於頁面展示，未納入結構化資料。
            </dd>
            <dd class="mt-4">
              <a href={site.mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-ga-event="review_click" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-black text-rice-800 underline decoration-rice-400 underline-offset-4 hover:text-rice-950">
                在谷歌地圖查看全部評價↗
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] bg-white p-6 card-shadow">
            <dt class="text-xs font-black tracking-[0.14em] text-rice-600">實景影像</dt>
            <dd class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-rice-800/72">
              網站實景影像以宜蘭縣政府「宜蘭勁好玩」與冬山鄉公所公開旅遊圖片為來源，並標註於頁尾。
            </dd>
            <dd class="mt-4">
              <a href={site.govtTourism.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-black text-rice-800 underline decoration-rice-400 underline-offset-4 hover:text-rice-950">
                {site.govtTourism.name}↗
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] bg-white p-6 card-shadow">
            <dt class="text-xs font-black tracking-[0.14em] text-rice-600">田況與農期</dt>
            <dd class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-rice-800/72">
              稻作季節與田況說明依往年農期與本季活動時程整理，最後更新 {fieldStatus.updatedAt}；現場仍以當日農務與公告為準。
            </dd>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] bg-white p-6 card-shadow">
            <dt class="text-xs font-black tracking-[0.14em] text-rice-600">位置與地圖</dt>
            <dd class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-rice-800/72">
              地址 {site.fullAddress}。地圖、評價與導航資訊以 Google 地圖為準，可於地圖中查看最新內容。
            </dd>
            <dd class="mt-4">
              <a href={site.mapsShareUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-black text-rice-800 underline decoration-rice-400 underline-offset-4 hover:text-rice-950">
                開啟 Google 地圖↗
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="pb-24 sm:pb-32">
    <div class="section-shell relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.75rem] bg-rice-950 px-8 py-16 text-center text-white sm:px-12 sm:py-24">
      <img src="/images/sanqi-green-road.jpg" alt="" width="1920" height="1279" loading="lazy" class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover opacity-20" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-rice-950/55"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <p class="font-serif text-lg tracking-[0.22em] text-grain-300">田野不趕時間</p>
        <h2 class="text-balance mt-5 font-serif text-4xl leading-tight font-black sm:text-6xl">選對季節，慢慢走完這條路</h2>
        <p class="pretty mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl leading-8 text-white/65">導航到奉尊宮附近，留一小時給稻田、風與遠山。若不是稻浪季，也把它當作冬山慢遊的一站。</p>
        <a href={site.mapUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-ga-event="map_click" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-grain-300 px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-black text-rice-950 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white">
          開啟地圖導航
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 5 7 7-7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
